Employee ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Enrollment Status: Submitted, Verified, Confirmed, Completed
Benefit Plan: Health, Dental, Vision, Life
Claim Amount: integer between 0 and 10000
Claim Status: Received, Processed, Approved, Denied, Paid
Premium Rate: float between 0.0 and 1.0
Deduction Amount: float between 0.0 and 5000.0
Inquiry Type: Enrollment, Claim, Eligibility, Payment
